  "integration": "image paths are relative to this file; src paths are relative to assets/images. Redrawn static bodies contain no crew, rear gun or propeller blades. Draw crew first so the airframe occludes it; propeller and rear gun go above the airframe. Crew atlas: 400x173 cells, four columns, idle loop 1.6 seconds. Propeller atlas: 20x128 cells, four columns, spin loop 0.12 seconds, fixed hub. Freeze phases in pause; hold propeller frame 0 when stopped and slow cadence with engine speed. Anchors are source pixels, scaled by plane.width/400 with owner rotation/camera. Gun rotation equals world aim minus PI; transform muzzle-pivot for the shot/flash origin. Both markings share geometry and moving layers. Airframe paths match the prior crew contract. Gameplay and Storybook code were not changed by this build; browser and unit tests were not run.",
